<title>SINGAPORE: Chuan Soon Huat 1996 profit up 8.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Chuan Soon Huat 1996 profit up 8.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>	   (in million of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   4.58  vs  4.23</p>
<p>    Group earnings (cents)  26.78  vs 24.75</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	     6.00  vs 30.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		    44.37  vs 40.41</p>
<p>    Other income		 0.18  vs  0.19</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   2.63  vs  1.93</p>
<p>    Pretax			 6.15  vs  6.46</p>
<p>    Tax			    1.58  vs  2.23</p>
<p>Note _ Chuan Soon Huat Industrial Group Ltd makes doors and joinery products.</p>
<p>_ Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
